<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan auctions 500 mln tenge bills April 22.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan auctions 500 mln tenge bills April 22.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 500 million tenge of three-month GKO discount Treasury bills on April 22, the National Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The bank provided the following details of the three-month issue --</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ43K2407973</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   500 million tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    91 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     April 22</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  July 17, 1997</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
